WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:03.690
Unit four. Making Digital Art!

2
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:09.354
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.404 --> 00:00:12.483
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:16.550
Today we learn about Making Digital Art. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.239 --> 00:00:22.604
Digital art. Say it with me. Digital art!

6
00:00:26.105 --> 00:00:30.493
Drawing tool. Say it with me. Drawing tool!

7
00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:38.158
Color palette. Say it with me. Color palette!

8
00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:45.166
Brush. Say it with me. Brush!

9
00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:52.584
Undo. Say it with me. Undo!

10
00:00:56.012 --> 00:01:00.678
Save file. Say it with me. Save file!

11
00:01:04.227 --> 00:01:08.227
Creative. Say it with me. Creative!

12
00:01:11.711 --> 00:01:15.848
Design. Say it with me. Design!

13
00:01:19.365 --> 00:01:31.251
I use a drawing tool and a color palette to make digital art. I can pick a brush and undo a mistake if I need to. Saving my file lets me keep my creative design forever.

14
00:01:31.301 --> 00:01:34.548
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.258 --> 00:01:40.893
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.943 --> 00:01:42.376
Color palette!

17
00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:48.572
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.622 --> 00:01:49.772
Creative!

19
00:01:50.796 --> 00:01:58.922
Did you know? Many famous artists today use digital art tools alongside paint and pencils!

20
00:01:58.972 --> 00:02:01.438
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:10.729
Think and answer. What would you like to design using digital art?

22
00:02:10.779 --> 00:02:11.929
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.918 --> 00:02:18.879
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:18.929 --> 00:02:22.030
